{"seq":1,"slug":"kmp-setup","title":"KMP 项目搭建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/kmp-setup","wordCount":644,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"kmp-项目搭建\">KMP 项目搭建</h1><p>Kotlin Multiplatform（KMP）允许在多个平台（Android、iOS、Desktop、Web）之间共享 Kotlin 代码。通过统一的项目结构和 Gradle 配置，开发者可以将业务逻辑、网络层、数据模型等代码编写一次，在多个平台上运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>KMP 的核心是<strong>一次编写、多平台运行</strong>：公共代码放在 <code>commonMain</code>，平台专属代码按源集分层，Gradle 配置负责把各源集编译到对应目标。业务逻辑、网络层、数据模型因此可以只写一遍；平台差异通过 <code>expect</code>/<code>actual</code> 在编译期对齐，而非运行时反射适配。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"kmp-项目结构\">KMP 项目结构</h2><p>标准的 KMP 项目遵循源集（Source Set）分层结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-kmp-project/&#10;├── build.gradle.kts&#10;├── settings.gradle.kts&#10;├── shared/&#10;│   ├── build.gradle.kts&#10;│   └── src/&#10;│       ├── commonMain/kotlin/       ← 公共代码&#10;│       ├── commonTest/kotlin/       ← 公共测试&#10;│       ├── androidMain/kotlin/      ← Android 特定实现&#10;│       ├── iosMain/kotlin/          ← iOS 特定实现&#10;│       ├── desktopMain/kotlin/      ← Desktop 特定实现&#10;│       └── wasmJsMain/kotlin/       ← Web 特定实现&#10;├── androidApp/                      ← Android 应用壳&#10;├── iosApp/                          ← iOS 应用壳 (Xcode)&#10;└── desktopApp/                      ← Desktop 应用壳\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-kmp-project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── settings.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── shared/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── commonMain/kotlin/       ← 公共代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── commonTest/kotlin/       ← 公共测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── androidMain/kotlin/      ← Android 特定实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── iosMain/kotlin/          ← iOS 特定实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── desktopMain/kotlin/      ← Desktop 特定实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── wasmJsMain/kotlin/       ← Web 特定实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── androidApp/                      ← Android 应用壳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── iosApp/                          ← iOS 应用壳 (Xcode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── desktopApp/                      ← Desktop 应用壳</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[commonMain] --&gt; B[androidMain]&#10;    A --&gt; C[iosMain]&#10;    A --&gt; D[desktopMain]&#10;    A --&gt; E[wasmJsMain]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; F[Android App]&#10;    C --&gt; G[iOS App]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Desktop App]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Web App]\">graph TD\n    A[commonMain] --&gt; B[androidMain]\n    A --&gt; C[iosMain]\n    A --&gt; D[desktopMain]\n    A --&gt; E[wasmJsMain]\n\n    B --&gt; F[Android App]\n    C --&gt; G[iOS App]\n    D --&gt; H[Desktop App]\n    E --&gt; I[Web App]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"gradle-配置\">Gradle 配置</h2><h3 id=\"settings-gradle-kts\">settings.gradle.kts</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"pluginManagement {&#10;    repositories {&#10;        google()&#10;        mavenCentral()&#10;        gradlePluginPortal()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencyResolutionManagement {&#10;    repositories {&#10;        google()&#10;        mavenCentral()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;rootProject.name = &quot;MyKmpProject&quot;&#10;include(&quot;:shared&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:androidApp&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:desktopApp&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pluginManagement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        google()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gradlePluginPortal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencyResolutionManagement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        google()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rootProject.name = \"MyKmpProject\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":shared\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":androidApp\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":desktopApp\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"shared-build-gradle-kts\">shared/build.gradle.kts</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;multiplatform&quot;)&#10;    id(&quot;com.android.library&quot;)&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.serialization&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;kotlin {&#10;    androidTarget {&#10;        compilations.all {&#10;            kotlinOptions {&#10;                jvmTarget = &quot;17&quot;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    listOf(&#10;        iosX64(),&#10;        iosArm64(),&#10;        iosSimulatorArm64()&#10;    ).forEach {&#10;        it.binaries.framework {&#10;            baseName = &quot;shared&quot;&#10;            isStatic = true&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    jvm(&quot;desktop&quot;)&#10;&#10;    sourceSets {&#10;        commonMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.7.3&quot;)&#10;            implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.6.0&quot;)&#10;            implementation(&quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-core:2.3.5&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        commonTest.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(kotlin(&quot;test&quot;))&#10;        }&#10;        androidMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(&quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-android:2.3.5&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        iosMain.dependencies {&#10;            implementation(&quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin:2.3.5&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        val desktopMain by getting {&#10;            dependencies {&#10;                implementation(&quot;io.ktor:ktor-client-cio:2.3.5&quot;)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;android {&#10;    namespace = &quot;com.example.shared&quot;&#10;    compileSdk = 34&#10;    defaultConfig {&#10;        minSdk = 24&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"multiplatform\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"com.android.library\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.serialization\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTarget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        compilations.all {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            kotlinOptions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                jvmTarget = \"17\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosX64(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosArm64(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosSimulatorArm64()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ).forEach {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        it.binaries.framework {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            baseName = \"shared\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isStatic = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jvm(\"desktop\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceSets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        commonMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.7.3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.6.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"io.ktor:ktor-client-core:2.3.5\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        commonTest.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(kotlin(\"test\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        androidMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"io.ktor:ktor-client-android:2.3.5\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosMain.dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            implementation(\"io.ktor:ktor-client-darwin:2.3.5\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val desktopMain by getting {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                implementation(\"io.ktor:ktor-client-cio:2.3.5\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    namespace = \"com.example.shared\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileSdk = 34</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        minSdk = 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> KMP 项目的 Gradle 配置是学习曲线最陡峭的部分。建议使用 JetBrains 的 KMP 向导 (kmp.jetbrains.com) 生成初始项目。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"expect-actual-机制概览\">expect/actual 机制概览</h2><p><code>expect</code>/<code>actual</code> 是 KMP 的核心机制，允许在公共代码中声明平台相关的接口，由各平台提供具体实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun platformName(): String&#10;&#10;expect class PlatformLogger() {&#10;    fun log(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual fun platformName(): String = &quot;Android&quot;&#10;&#10;actual class PlatformLogger actual constructor() {&#10;    actual fun log(message: String) {&#10;        android.util.Log.d(&quot;KMP&quot;, message)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun platformName(): String = &quot;iOS&quot;&#10;&#10;actual class PlatformLogger actual constructor() {&#10;    actual fun log(message: String) {&#10;        platform.Foundation.NSLog(message)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun platformName(): String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect class PlatformLogger() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun log(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun platformName(): String = \"Android\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class PlatformLogger actual constructor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun log(message: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        android.util.Log.d(\"KMP\", message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun platformName(): String = \"iOS\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual class PlatformLogger actual constructor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    actual fun log(message: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        platform.Foundation.NSLog(message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"源集层次结构\">源集层次结构</h2><p>KMP 支持中间源集，实现代码在部分平台间共享：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[commonMain] --&gt; B[nativeMain]&#10;    A --&gt; C[jvmMain]&#10;    B --&gt; D[iosMain]&#10;    B --&gt; E[linuxMain]&#10;    C --&gt; F[androidMain]&#10;    C --&gt; G[desktopMain]&#10;    D --&gt; H[iosArm64Main]&#10;    D --&gt; I[iosX64Main]&#10;    D --&gt; J[iosSimulatorArm64Main]\">graph TD\n    A[commonMain] --&gt; B[nativeMain]\n    A --&gt; C[jvmMain]\n    B --&gt; D[iosMain]\n    B --&gt; E[linuxMain]\n    C --&gt; F[androidMain]\n    C --&gt; G[desktopMain]\n    D --&gt; H[iosArm64Main]\n    D --&gt; I[iosX64Main]\n    D --&gt; J[iosSimulatorArm64Main]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"kotlin {&#10;    sourceSets {&#10;        val nativeMain by creating {&#10;            dependsOn(commonMain.get())&#10;        }&#10;        iosMain {&#10;            dependsOn(nativeMain)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sourceSets {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val nativeMain by creating {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dependsOn(commonMain.get())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        iosMain {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dependsOn(nativeMain)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>源集层级</th>\n<th>涵盖平台</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>commonMain</code></td>\n<td>所有平台</td>\n<td>业务逻辑、数据模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nativeMain</code></td>\n<td>所有 Native 平台</td>\n<td>原生内存管理相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jvmMain</code></td>\n<td>Android + Desktop</td>\n<td>JVM 特有 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iosMain</code></td>\n<td>所有 iOS 架构</td>\n<td>Apple 特定 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ide-支持\">IDE 支持</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IDE</th>\n<th>支持程度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Android Studio</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>通过 KMP 插件支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IntelliJ IDEA</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fleet</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>JetBrains 新一代 IDE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xcode</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分</td>\n<td>需要 SKIE 或 KMP 框架桥接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>使用 KMP 向导创建项目的推荐流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[访问 kmp.jetbrains.com] --&gt; B[选择目标平台]&#10;    B --&gt; C[选择共享模块功能]&#10;    C --&gt; D[下载项目模板]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用 Android Studio 打开]&#10;    E --&gt; F[同步 Gradle]&#10;    F --&gt; G[开始开发]\">flowchart LR\n    A[访问 kmp.jetbrains.com] --&gt; B[选择目标平台]\n    B --&gt; C[选择共享模块功能]\n    C --&gt; D[下载项目模板]\n    D --&gt; E[用 Android Studio 打开]\n    E --&gt; F[同步 Gradle]\n    F --&gt; G[开始开发]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见问题\">常见问题</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>Gradle 同步失败</strong>：确保 Kotlin Multiplatform Gradle 插件版本与 Kotlin 版本一致</li>\n<li><strong>iOS 编译缓慢</strong>：使用 <code>isStatic = true</code> 生成静态框架，开启增量编译</li>\n<li><strong>依赖冲突</strong>：使用 <code>api()</code> 和 <code>implementation()</code> 正确管理依赖传递</li>\n<li><strong>CocoaPods 集成</strong>：可选使用 <code>cocoapods</code> 插件或 SPM（Swift Package Manager）</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> KMP 生态在快速演进中，建议定期查看 Kotlin 官方博客了解最新变化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>KMP</strong> 通过共享 Kotlin 代码实现多平台开发，覆盖 Android、iOS、Desktop、Web</li>\n<li>项目结构基于<strong>源集</strong>（Source Set），<code>commonMain</code> 存放公共代码，各平台源集存放特定实现</li>\n<li><strong>Gradle 配置</strong>定义目标平台、依赖和编译选项，是项目搭建的核心</li>\n<li><strong>expect/actual</strong> 机制桥接公共接口与平台实现</li>\n<li>中间源集（如 <code>nativeMain</code>、<code>jvmMain</code>）允许在部分平台间共享代码</li>\n<li>推荐使用 KMP 向导生成初始项目模板，减少手动配置错误</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"KMP 项目搭建","id":"kmp-项目搭建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"KMP 项目结构","id":"kmp-项目结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Gradle 配置","id":"gradle-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"settings.gradle.kts","id":"settings-gradle-kts"},{"level":3,"text":"shared/build.gradle.kts","id":"shared-build-gradle-kts"},{"level":2,"text":"expect/actual 机制概览","id":"expect-actual-机制概览"},{"level":2,"text":"源集层次结构","id":"源集层次结构"},{"level":2,"text":"IDE 支持","id":"ide-支持"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题","id":"常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DSL 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/dsl-design"},"next":{"title":"expect/actual 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/expect-actual"}}